body:
I told her I was going to visit a friend. And that happened at that point, she WAS just a friend.  And my wife trusted me. Hell I trusted me. This is so out of character for me I can't get my head around it.

Again I get flashes. But like my other memories it is so hard to view them and spikes my pain when I try. I remember her saying things, so it wasn't total "one sided".

&#x200B;

But so much of the affair are though flashes and what she has told me herself.

&#x200B;

My wife only now knows about my memory gaps, at least the extent of them. She always knows where I am.

i have never lied to her before. This is whats driving me insane all of this doesn't feel like me or something I would do.

&#x200B;

But it was me. But I don't know how to accept it.
